      "Contains casein and whey concentrate, so more lactose",
      "Still around $2.28 to $2.64 per 25 g",
      "No independent certification seal"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "Choose it over the isolate if you tolerate dairy well and want the lowest Gainful price per gram.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "23 g (brand)",
      "Calories": "120",
      "Contains casein": "Yes (micellar casein)",
