          </p>

          <p>
            Two things move the number. Flavor packets cost extra; the flavored Everyday bundles we saw listed at $38.99 against $33.99 for unflavored, so flavor adds about $5 per 14 servings. Discounts move it the other way: the product pages carried a 30 percent sitewide Black Friday code when we checked, and subscribe-and-save offers have varied over time. A 30 percent discount would bring Isolate-Only to under $2 per 25 g, which is competitive. Check what the cart actually charges, then divide by total grams of protein; our <a href="/protein-calculator/">protein calculator</a> helps with the daily target side of that sum.
