        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Gainful makes clean, short-label protein, and its Isolate-Only Whey is a genuinely good product: 25 g of protein, two ingredients and no sweetener. What it does not have is verifiable testing. The brand says a third party checks its lots, but names no lab, publishes no results and holds no sport certification.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            At $2.28 to $3.04 per 25 g of protein, that leaves Gainful as a buy for people who value the unflavored base and flavor packets enough to pay for them, ideally with a discount code. Athletes and value buyers have better options among certified isolates.
